      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好！让我用飞快的速度去从教室拿来给你吧！\n我私人收藏的护身符……\n“十年前的中奖冰棒棍”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26f1c42fbb9c89ee5dc1f5928b5ea6eb6d61a128ed2f551b28e66a6d6f9fd3e7",
