      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是名将怒涛继续吃着冰棒，\n而待兼福来则在一旁为她加油打气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5cb92b7d10e32d3ab2e34f25747405d2cf2a8e672a4c3bb2170730b4ae9695",
